      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean yeah i know i should check with a doctor but it's like 3am here and i really dont want to sit in an ER for 8 hours if i can help it. the pain is exactly like the last time i had a stone so it's probably just that. how can i tell for sure if it's just a stone and not something else? like is there anything i can take or do at home to help the pain pass?",
